#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:3
#: b0cd320c5efc4d1cb028e48e7786da74
msgid "有限晶胞合金占位（Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy）"
msgstr "Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:5
#: 6fbd701bfceb4afa96222b68f033c7bb
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and Composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:7
#: e5fff39d1b8d428ea8a5f6c5a790f8ab
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:9
#: 8d47626f108a4365a31b059a64da176b
msgid ""
"这张卡把合金比例落实为有限晶胞中真正可实现的整数原子数，再为每种整数组成生成不重复的占位排布。输入含 "
"`atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]` 时，各子晶格分别约束；没有该数组时，全部位点属于名为 `all` 的单一位点集合。"
msgstr ""
"Convert alloy fractions into integer atom counts that are physically "
"realizable in a finite cell, then generate unique site arrangements for "
"every integer composition. If the input contains "
"`atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]`, each sublattice is constrained "
"separately. Otherwise, all sites belong to one site set named `all`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:11
#: ff283dff06164242b02525e5469315d9
msgid "组成模式有三种："
msgstr "Three composition modes are available:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:13
#: 46eba17933824f94864a88d41f865434
msgid ""
"`fixed_fraction`：指定固定目标比例；可整除时记为 `exact`，否则用最大余数法得到最近整数计划，并记为 "
"`nearest_integer`。"
msgstr ""
"`fixed_fraction`: specify fixed target fractions. A target that maps "
"exactly to integer counts is marked `exact`; otherwise, the largest-"
"remainder method produces the nearest integer plan, marked "
"`nearest_integer`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:14
#: 6cda9af0d59844c39573095906c48fee
msgid "`fraction_range`：枚举实际整数占比落在各元素范围内的计划。"
msgstr ""
"`fraction_range`: enumerate plans whose realized integer fractions fall "
"within the specified range for every element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:15
#: fb5d46dae71f4103a22f61a8b73e4f7a
msgid "`count_range`：枚举各元素整数计数落在范围内、且总和等于位点数的计划。"
msgstr ""
"`count_range`: enumerate plans whose integer count for every element "
"falls within its range and whose total equals the number of sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:17
#: 6f17b6e0a84d496a98e53d4fd351a39a
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:19
#: be13f26a554040d699ef732b1c6e4c11
msgid "有限晶胞不能实现任意连续比例。一个位点集合含 $N$ 个位点时，程序寻找满足"
msgstr ""
"A finite cell cannot realize arbitrary continuous fractions. For a site "
"set containing $N$ sites, the program searches for integer counts "
"satisfying"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:21
#: 73e57c4fb2594db387f8fd10efeb27f5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"n_e\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0},\\qquad \\sum_e n_e=N\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:25
#: 931a25540cf24c639927cb67b65e4c99
msgid "的整数计数。无量纲占比范围 $f_e\\in[0,1]$ 会转换为"
msgstr "A dimensionless fraction range $f_e\\in[0,1]$ is converted to"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:27
#: 4de815eaf5cf40ca8409fe87230c5764
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\lceil f_{e,\\min}N\\rceil\\le n_e\\le\\lfloor f_{e,\\max}N\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\lceil f_{e,\\min}N\\rceil\\le n_e\\le\\lfloor f_{e,\\max}N\\rfloor.\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:31
#: 450b794a89ce40049b19f38721abf3f9
msgid "给定一组计数后，该位点集合的不同排布总数为"
msgstr ""
"For a given set of counts, the total number of distinct arrangements on "
"that site set is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:33
#: 6d0c2678248849eaa9b3d9570330bbad
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Omega=\\frac{N!}{\\prod_e n_e!}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:37
#: 5529ce8ef1374677899702fa209b8d14
msgid ""
"多个子晶格的排布数是各自 $\\Omega$ 的乘积。设选中的整数组成集合为 $P$，每种组成请求 $A$ 个排布，总输出上限为 "
"$M$，则实际输出数为"
msgstr ""
"For multiple sublattices, their arrangement counts multiply. Let $P$ be "
"the selected set of integer compositions, $A$ the requested arrangements "
"per composition, and $M$ the overall output limit. The actual output "
"count is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:39
#: 1641718372b141cd809447101372aa83
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=\\min\\left(M,\\sum_{i\\in P}\\min(A,\\Omega_i)\\right).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:43
#: 051ac75c57644b23a333122792d65178
msgid "当预算不足时，卡片先覆盖不同组成，再轮流增加每种组成的第 2、第 3 个排布。它不会复制排布凑数，也不会把超出预算的结果称为已穷举。"
msgstr ""
"When the budget is insufficient, the card covers distinct compositions "
"first, then adds a second, third, and further arrangement to each "
"composition in rounds. It neither duplicates arrangements to fill the "
"quota nor describes results beyond the budget as exhaustively enumerated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:45
#: 80492fb09c944e51be887c8b2e677ec6
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:47
#: cc5d1a75b72040a8b661d2d62bdd0948
msgid "小晶胞 HEA 的多个目标比例落到同一实际组成"
msgstr ""
"Multiple Target Fractions Collapse to the Same Composition in a Small-"
"Cell HEA"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:49
#: 18c6614df40f469d84ee5d80a5d18bc1
msgid ""
"32 位点随机固溶体若先采连续比例再取整，多个目标点可能变成同一整数计数组合。此时应直接使用“计数范围”枚举 Fe/Co/Ni "
"的可行计数，设置“每种组成的排布数”为 4，并用“每个输入的最大输出数”控制规模。"
msgstr ""
"If continuous fractions are sampled and rounded for a 32-site random "
"solid solution, several target points may collapse to the same integer-"
"count combination. Instead, use `Count range` to enumerate feasible "
"Fe/Co/Ni counts directly, set `Arrangements per composition` to 4, and "
"control the scale with `Maximum outputs per input`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:51
#: 7369530cf5344012ae5153e31ec6bb91
msgid ""
"输出中，相同实际计数组合具有相同的 composition ID；同一 composition 下的 arrangement ID "
"不重复。验证时应检查每帧 `counts` 之和为 32、`(composition_id, arrangement_id)` 二元组唯一，并按 "
"metadata 中的实际占比切片比较模型误差。"
msgstr ""
"Outputs with the same realized count combination share a composition ID, "
"while arrangement IDs are unique within a composition. During validation,"
" check that `counts` sum to 32 in every frame, that each "
"`(composition_id, arrangement_id)` pair is unique, and compare model "
"errors in slices defined by the realized fractions stored in metadata."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:53
#: 1c59a979a647477393eb8804dd1f2db5
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:55
#: 1584a7b3b1254982b68165a0b705ae80
msgid "位点划分规则（site_rules）"
msgstr "site_rules"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:57
#: 619dd41a3fae4eabb4ac7c6352308b91
msgid ""
"可视化编辑器用于选择“全部位点”或“按子晶格”，并为每个位点集合设置元素和组成模式。JSON 顶层 key 必须与输入的 `sublattice`"
" 标签完全一致；无标签结构只使用 `all`。`group` 不会代替 `sublattice`。"
msgstr ""
"The visual editor selects either `All sites` or `By sublattice` and "
"assigns elements and a composition mode to each site set. Top-level JSON "
"keys must exactly match the input `sublattice` labels. An unlabeled "
"structure uses only `all`; `group` does not substitute for `sublattice`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:59
#: d245d2d391154dfc8f8892dd3e6f9b52
msgid ""
"未手动编辑规则时，接入上游结构会按**首个输入结构**的标签、元素和当前占比自动匹配规则。默认模板中的 `X` "
"只是占位符，不能输出；手动编辑、选择模板、粘贴 JSON 或恢复持久化参数后，规则不再被自动覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Before rules are edited manually, connecting an upstream structure "
"automatically matches rules to the labels, elements, and current "
"fractions of the **first input structure**. `X` in the default template "
"is only a placeholder and cannot appear in output. After manual editing, "
"template selection, JSON pasting, or restoration of persisted parameters,"
" the rules are no longer overwritten automatically."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:61
#: 4904ef5edda04cfab036f07d96a2e82f
msgid ""
"固定比例为无量纲数，范围是 $[0,1]$，且可视化编辑器要求同一位点集合内的比例和为 1。计数范围的单位是“个位点”，上下限必须是非负整数。旧 "
"JSON 中 `1 + 1` 这类相对权重仍可由底层归一化，但新规则应直接填写 `0.5 + 0.5`。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed fractions are dimensionless values in $[0,1]$, and the visual "
"editor requires them to sum to 1 within each site set. Count ranges are "
"measured in sites and require nonnegative integer bounds. The backend can"
" still normalize legacy JSON containing relative weights such as `1 + 1`,"
" but new rules should enter `0.5 + 0.5` directly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:63
#: daa09bea54cc4b0fb55c80d91f5f86f2
msgid "规则示例："
msgstr "Example rule:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:65
#: dce89a90d6ea4c47abee2e1b8247ffa9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\"A\":{\"elements\":[\"Fe\",\"Co\"],\"mode\":\"count_range\",\"counts\":{\"Fe\":[8,16],\"Co\":[8,16]}}}"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"{\"A\":{\"elements\":[\"Fe\",\"Co\"],\"mode\":\"count_range\",\"counts\":{\"Fe\":[8,16],\"Co\":[8,16]}}}"
"\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:69
#: 5b0744484d414152bb91285e1c97e7d0
msgid ""
"“高级：查看或粘贴 JSON”可复制或载入旧规则；非法 JSON "
"不会覆盖当前有效规则。切换位点划分或应用模板会替换整组规则，已有手动编辑时界面会先确认。"
msgstr ""
"`Advanced: View or paste JSON` can copy or load legacy rules. Invalid "
"JSON does not overwrite the current valid rules. Changing the site "
"partition or applying a template replaces the entire rule set, and the "
"interface asks for confirmation if manual edits already exist."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:71
#: 5330354a705c479aa164898b738fcda1
msgid "每种组成的排布数（arrangements_per_composition）"
msgstr "arrangements_per_composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:73
#: ce0fde445f9a43988a666e9894accf21
msgid "`int`，默认 1，单位为“个结构”。它表示每种实际整数组成请求多少个不同排布；若理论排布数 $\\Omega$ 更少，则只返回实际存在的数量。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1, measured in structures. This is the requested number of"
" distinct arrangements for each realized integer composition. If the "
"theoretical count $\\Omega$ is smaller, only the arrangements that "
"actually exist are returned."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:75
#: 15a153ba0c884d35a743686b9d5ad5f9
msgid "使用固定种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:77
#: f607ca7b9f5b430fa3f1eea9804cd13b
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。开启后，组成预算抽样和具体位点排布均由固定 seed 派生。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. When enabled, both composition-budget sampling and "
"concrete site arrangements are derived from a fixed seed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:79
#: eff725d8fc0d48578ee7cda4eee3f397
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:81
#: aeb3770293a64579819937f1265a15d1
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0，无单位，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。相同输入、规则和 seed "
"会得到相同结果。若所有可行组成都在预算内，改变 seed 不改变可行计数集合，只改变排布；若 `max_outputs` 截断了组成集合，seed"
" 也会改变被选中的整数组成。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 0, dimensionless and used only when `use_seed=true`. The "
"same input, rules, and seed produce the same results. If every feasible "
"composition fits within the budget, changing the seed alters arrangements"
" but not the feasible count set. If `max_outputs` truncates the "
"composition set, the seed also affects which integer compositions are "
"selected."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:83
#: 672d4d1d9ba84408b3a33856e7b14a3d
msgid "每个输入的最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Maximum Outputs per Input (max_outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:85
#: 3cc8db50f67d4f2588c297e7eff8dd97
msgid "`int`，默认 200，单位为“个结构”。它限制每个输入结构返回的总结构数，并采用“先覆盖组成、再增加排布”的分配顺序。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 200, measured in structures. It limits the total "
"structures returned for each input and allocates them in the order `cover"
" compositions first, then add arrangements`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:87
#: 0d2fc2c31dfa4dd6896cb2eeb97c30c7
msgid "输出预览与失败条件"
msgstr "Output Preview and Failure Conditions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:89
#: ce40eb4708e04591b9cace37302fe961
msgid ""
"UI 只用数据集的**首个输入结构**计算位点数、可行整数组成数和输出上界。若同一数据集中的结构具有不同原子数、`sublattice` "
"标签或位点数，后续结构会按各自真实位点重新计算，输出数可能不同，也可能因规则不匹配而失败；这类数据最好分组处理。"
msgstr ""
"The UI uses only the **first input structure** in the dataset to "
"calculate site counts, feasible integer-composition counts, and the "
"output upper bound. If structures in the same dataset differ in atom "
"count, `sublattice` labels, or site counts, later structures are "
"recalculated using their actual sites. Their output counts may differ, or"
" they may fail because the rules do not match. Such data are best "
"processed in separate groups."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:91
#: fb7cf3332c1049989027451b487c07dc
msgid ""
"以下情况会显式失败，不会返回伪成功的空结果：规则与位点集合不匹配、仍含 "
"`X`、比例或计数范围非法，以及没有可行整数解。对于排布空间很大的组成，程序采用有上限的去重随机尝试；若尝试耗尽而未达到本应存在的目标数量，也会显式报告已生成数量与请求数量。"
msgstr ""
"The following conditions fail explicitly instead of returning a falsely "
"successful empty result: rules that do not match site sets, remaining `X`"
" placeholders, invalid fraction or count ranges, and no feasible integer "
"solution. For compositions with very large arrangement spaces, the "
"program makes a bounded number of deduplicated random attempts. If "
"attempts are exhausted before reaching a target count that should exist, "
"it explicitly reports both the generated and requested counts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:93
#: dfb08b227b0f4e37a093dbbc6d25bf6a
msgid "推荐配置"
msgstr "Recommended Configuration"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:95
#: e1d1bdcab4e34b30b0e57381841d366a
msgid "32 位点二元合金可从以下规则开始，再按训练集缺口收紧计数范围："
msgstr ""
"For a 32-site binary alloy, begin with the following rule and then narrow"
" the count ranges according to gaps in the training set:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:97
#: 112950010a1444219f9393839530a149
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"FiniteCellAlloyOccupancyCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"site_rules\": "
"\"{\\\"A\\\":{\\\"elements\\\":[\\\"Fe\\\",\\\"Co\\\"],\\\"mode\\\":\\\"count_range\\\",\\\"counts\\\":{\\\"Fe\\\":[8,24],\\\"Co\\\":[8,24]}}}\","
"\n"
"    \"arrangements_per_composition\": 4,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 17,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 68\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"FiniteCellAlloyOccupancyCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"site_rules\": "
"\"{\\\"A\\\":{\\\"elements\\\":[\\\"Fe\\\",\\\"Co\\\"],\\\"mode\\\":\\\"count_range\\\",\\\"counts\\\":{\\\"Fe\\\":[8,24],\\\"Co\\\":[8,24]}}}\","
"\n"
"    \"arrangements_per_composition\": 4,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 17,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 68\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:110
#: 696c9391eff04012be0cb6cff6b909ee
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:112
#: 1534549e69b94518a242e0d8f26d1ef6
#
msgid "`有序合金原型 → 有限晶胞合金占位`：保留 L1₂、B2、L1₀ 等原型的子晶格划分，并在各子晶格内生成受约束的无序占位。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`: preserve the "
"sublattice partition of prototypes such as L1₂, B2, and L1₀ while "
"generating constrained disordered occupancy within each sublattice."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:113
#: 88fcd3c1ac2246cb8126e47bbc423b49
msgid "`晶体原型构建 → 扩胞 → 有限晶胞合金占位`：先得到足够位点，再生成可实现的随机固溶体组成。"
msgstr "`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`: create enough sites first, then generate realizable random-solid-solution compositions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:114
#: 2e6cc9915cc041cab656ec00883c5ef7
msgid "`有限晶胞合金占位 → 原子扰动 → 晶格应变`：先确定占位，再补充坐标和晶格扰动。"
msgstr "`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy → Atomic Perturb → Lattice Strain`: determine occupancy first, then add coordinate and lattice perturbations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:116
#: fc0ce36b4ccc477d94e835a6ceb2daa7
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:118
#: 3b3634fc54194c099aea1767cd8e543c
msgid "**为什么输出少于请求值？** 某种组成的理论排布数可能不足，或总输出已达到 `max_outputs`；卡片不会复制结构凑数。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are there fewer outputs than requested?** A composition may have "
"too few theoretical arrangements, or the total output may have reached "
"`max_outputs`. The card does not duplicate structures to fill the quota."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:120
#: 629c697bf0ee47ffa47af43fa18f252d
msgid "**为什么提示规则不匹配？** 顶层 key 必须逐一匹配输入的 `sublattice` 标签；无标签结构只能使用 `all`。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are the rules reported as mismatched?** Each top-level key must "
"match an input `sublattice` label exactly. An unlabeled structure can use"
" only `all`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:122
#: acfd2bebb7084af5b2159cf95771799d
msgid "**为什么没有整数解？** 各元素下限之和可能大于位点数，或上限之和小于位点数；占比范围也会先换算为当前晶胞可实现的整数边界。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is there no integer solution?** The sum of element lower bounds may"
" exceed the number of sites, or the upper bounds may sum to less than the"
" number of sites. Fraction ranges are also converted first to integer "
"bounds realizable in the current cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:124
#: d618fbf8f5b842498ad9aa54a366e2f4
msgid "输出标签与可复现性"
msgstr "Output Labels and Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:126
#: ef4d7afe767140adba25f954d91e08a2
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 追加 "
"`FiniteAlloy(comp=<composition_id>,arr=<arrangement_id>)`。`finite_cell_alloy`"
" metadata 保存实际 `counts`、`fractions`、请求规则、实现状态、composition ID、arrangement "
"ID 和派生 seed。"
msgstr ""
"`FiniteAlloy(comp=<composition_id>,arr=<arrangement_id>)` is appended to "
"`Config_type`. The `finite_cell_alloy` metadata stores realized `counts` "
"and `fractions`, requested rules, realization status, composition ID, "
"arrangement ID, and derived seed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:128
#: 7382ba5f37be41eea5f79bc8046253c3
msgid "固定 `use_seed=true` 和 `seed` 后结果可复现；关闭固定种子后不保证重复运行得到相同组成抽样或排布。"
msgstr ""
"Results are reproducible with fixed `use_seed=true` and `seed`. With "
"fixed seeding disabled, repeated runs are not guaranteed to produce the "
"same composition sample or arrangements."

